{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>ויחנטו אותו.</b> The physicians." "<b>ויישם בארון.</b> He placed him; now the root is ישם, on the pattern of וייצר (Genesis 2:7). R. Yona the grammarian said that the chirik stands in place of a shureq, but this is far-fetched in my eyes." "The sense of בארון with a kamatz in the bet is that he prepared for himself." "<b>חסלת פרשת ויחי</b><br>The book of Genesis is completed, with the help of El, blessed be He."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:43.912940580Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}